  "sourceUrl": "https://textcreationpartnership.org/",
  "sourceEdition": "A94797: London, 1649/1650 (A Clavis to the Bible: a new comment upon the Pentateuch); A63066: London, 1657 (Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther, Job and Psalms); A63069: London, 1660 (Proverbs-Daniel, third volume of annotations); A63068: London, 1654 (the XII minor prophets); A63067: London, 1647 (this TCP file's title promises John and Acts too, but the XML itself ends at Luke 24:53 — see PROVENANCE.md); A63065: London, 1647 (all the Epistles and Revelation)",
